                <note rend="inline" type="source">365D.1163/16: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister Resident in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis
                                Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-12-14T13:00:00+03:00">December 14, 1936—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 6:47 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>679. Department’s 399, December 10, 8 p.m.<anchor n="75" xml:id="d395-f1"/>
                    British Legation informs me that London has likewise made representations to the
                    Italian Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
